+//! Bounded, source-preserving imports for a source-owning embedded host.
+//!
+//! The ordinary desktop readers retain their existing behavior. Here a streaming ZIP
+//! admission pass checks every member and CRC before the genuine native/PPTX reader
+//! receives the same immutable bytes. No document is added to a Session by this module.
